WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,180
The majestic prince returned home and couldn't even eat food.

2
00:00:07,180 --> 00:00:08,940
It can be seen that he is used to being bullied.

3
00:00:08,940 --> 00:00:10,860
How dare you bully my husband?

4
00:00:10,860 --> 00:00:15,180
Today I will teach you what social evil is called Shen Chao

5
00:00:15,180 --> 00:00:16,780
I didn't use any force

6
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,860
Mom, I'm fine

7
00:00:18,860 --> 00:00:21,090
Azhao was also careless

8
00:00:21,090 --> 00:00:22,830
You're pretending

9
00:00:22,830 --> 00:00:24,270
You are definitely faking it

10
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:25,390
I didn't at all

11
00:00:25,390 --> 00:00:29,150
If you don't want to eat, get out.

12
00:00:29,150 --> 00:00:30,830
No matter how much I messed around in the past

13
00:00:30,830 --> 00:00:32,670
My brother can only give me a few words of scolding with a straight face.

14
00:00:33,070 --> 00:00:35,310
I will never be held back from the stage in front of outsiders.

15
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:36,750
But today

16
00:00:36,750 --> 00:00:38,830
For a woman who just walked in for a day

17
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:44,820
She actually told me to fuck off, Ah Zhao, wow

18
00:00:44,820 --> 00:00:46,980
My husband

19
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:49,540
It seems much more ferocious than I imagined.
